 critical infrastructure, trust the ZTI Tri-hole Stripper for dependable performance every time.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Triple-hole design for efficient multi-layer stripping</li><li>Removes 2-3 mm jacket, 900 µm buffer, and 250 µm coating</li><li>Ergonomic grips for comfort and control</li><li>High-durability construction for long-term use</li><li>Ideal for fiber optic cable installation and maintenance</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/etopel-et-a03-fiber-stripper\">ETOPEL ET-A03 Fiber Stripper</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">1,300৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">1,500৳</span> \n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                                